('node-13-8', 'phase-13-lesson-08-track-b-high-throughput-llm-inference-opt', 'module-14', 8, 'Lesson 14.8: Track B: High-Throughput LLM Inference Optimization: TensorRT-LLM & vLLM', 'Prerequisites: Phase 10, Phase 11, Lesson 11.23', 'Prerequisites: Phase 10, Phase 11, Lesson 11.23 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 360, 14, 3370.0, 400.0, '# Lesson 13.8: Track B: High-Throughput LLM Inference Optimization: TensorRT-LLM & vLLM

